# Quarantined raw exports — preserve bytes exactly as acquired.
#
# The repo checks out with core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite these LF
# files to CRLF and change their SHA-256, breaking the checksums recorded in
# README.md as tamper-evidence. `-text` disables all EOL conversion so the
# working copy always matches the hashes in the rejection record.
*.csv -text
